{"change_summary":"Updated provenance handling so developer-facing formatting now renders `notes` alongside units/source/confidence/range, and `ParamMeta` rejects unknown metadata fields during deserialization. Added `ProcessParamsPreset` validation for unknown `param_meta` parameter names with regression coverage, and revalidated the required `tank_core`/`tank_data` test targets after the stage-cohort build regression.","outstanding_risks":["The worktree still contains unrelated pre-existing edits outside this fix scope (`crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs`, `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs`, `crates/tank_core/tests/budget_tracking.rs`, `crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs`, `crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs`, `crates/tank_tui/src/main.rs`) plus untracked `.ralph-burning/`; they were left untouched.","Unknown `param_meta` names now fail through `ProcessParamsPreset::validate()` and the normal `load_process_params()` path, but callers that deserialize `ProcessParamsPreset` directly still need to invoke `validate()` to get that diagnostic."],"steps":[{"description":"Reproduced the reported regression and rechecked the `tank_core`/`tank_data` targets so the current stage-cohort tree compiled cleanly again on the required commands.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated `crates/tank_core/src/types/provenance.rs` so `ParamMeta` display output includes `notes`, and added stricter deserialization with `deny_unknown_fields`.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` so `ProcessParamsPreset::validate()` rejects unknown `param_meta` keys and added coverage for the new diagnostic plus the notes-inclusive formatter output.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran the targeted and broader library tests to confirm the provenance fixes and compile path were stable.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core --lib provenance` passed: 9 provenance tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_data --lib` passed: 13 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib` passed: 42 tests passed, 0 failed."]}